{"4899650": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Domain Paradox: Growth", "steam_appid": 4899650, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Log 31:</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;I can't seem to get past the sixth collector, it's just too hard. Sometimes you <strong>miss an anomaly - and everything resets</strong>, throwing you back to the thirteenth collector. It doesn't sound complicated, the anomalies are very noticeable in the domain, but all of this... The fatigue, the tension, the fear... I feel like I'm never getting out of here.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4899650/extras/a00aa98710587bd75215d9fb84a01cd3.poster.avif?t=1787414673\" width=780 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4899650/extras/a00aa98710587bd75215d9fb84a01cd3.webm?t=1787414673\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4899650/extras/a00aa98710587bd75215d9fb84a01cd3.mp4?t=1787414673\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Log 48:</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;I just saw... /<i>heavy breathing/</i>A TV, and inside it... myself. Someone was filming me... RIGHT NEXT TO ME! But I couldn't see who it was, so I chose to run asap. /<i>heavy breathing/ </i>   <br>I don't understand why <strong>there are hundreds of unique anomalies</strong> here causing nothing but discomfort... and not a single one that brings comfort!&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4899650/extras/c28354a396f2044d8c0a91745a9910ed.poster.avif?t=1787414673\" width=780 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4899650/extras/c28354a396f2044d8c0a91745a9910ed.webm?t=1787414673\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4899650/extras/c28354a396f2044d8c0a91745a9910ed.mp4?t=1787414673\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Log 65:</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;I never thought mannequins could be so weird. Last time, they were standing around a disassembled mannequin... They have no faces, but I could feel their grief. <strong>This time, they were hiding... But from whom?</strong> I'll get out of here as fast as I can, I don't think I should linger... Why are you... /<i>indistinct noises</i>/&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4899650/extras/86afdea3a12aff8a1b95955bb3db4dc9.avif?t=1787414673\" width=780 height=260 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>Why this game?</i></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Lore</strong> - a multi-layered story that unfolds as you play.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Walking Simulator</strong> - search for and spot anomalies. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Oppressive Atmosphere</strong> - face your fears in a First-Person game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Zero Hand-Holding</strong> - pure realism with minimal hints.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Difficulty System</strong> - keeps you on the edge of your seat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Focused Exploration</strong> - no keys, no notes, no filler quests.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>100+ Unique Anomalies</strong> - for total immersion.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Sound Design</strong> - professional voice acting and custom audio effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hidden Easter Eggs</strong> - something special for everyone to discover.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Log 31:</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;I can't seem to get past the sixth collector, it's just too hard. Sometimes you <strong>miss an anomaly - and everything resets</strong>, throwing you back to the thirteenth collector. It doesn't sound complicated, the anomalies are very noticeable in the domain, but all of this... The fatigue, the tension, the fear... I feel like I'm never getting out of here.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4899650/extras/a00aa98710587bd75215d9fb84a01cd3.poster.avif?t=1787414673\" width=780 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4899650/extras/a00aa98710587bd75215d9fb84a01cd3.webm?t=1787414673\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4899650/extras/a00aa98710587bd75215d9fb84a01cd3.mp4?t=1787414673\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Log 48:</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;I just saw... /<i>heavy breathing/</i>A TV, and inside it... myself. Someone was filming me... RIGHT NEXT TO ME! But I couldn't see who it was, so I chose to run asap. /<i>heavy breathing/ </i>   <br>I don't understand why <strong>there are hundreds of unique anomalies</strong> here causing nothing but discomfort... and not a single one that brings comfort!&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster