 Exploration</strong> - no keys, no notes, no filler quests.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>100+ Unique Anomalies</strong> - for total immersion.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Sound Design</strong> - professional voice acting and custom audio effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hidden Easter Eggs</strong> - something special for everyone to discover.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Search. Remember. Escape. Or you will never leave the domain. Explore anomalies and unravel the story of a scientist sent on an expedition, avoiding dangers and clinging to the last shred of hope: finding a way out.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Ukrainian<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4899650/38a1325e904475029af6924f9413cda3d6bb66bc/header.jpg?t=1787414673", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4899650/4a1ec2caaa8a441c885cc4aae81d4204b564f75b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787414673", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4899650/4a1ec2caaa8a441c885cc4aae81d4204b564f75b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787414673", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen 5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce RTX 2070<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 15 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen 7<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 32 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3070<br></li><li